## Title: Under Pressure
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 0.4.0
## AddOnVersion: 14
## APIVersion: 101051
## SavedVariables: UnderPressureSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20200
## Description: Quickly see how much danger you are in with simple HUD elements designed to alert you to impending doom. Threat Indicator: Shows how long you can survive under current incoming damage and effects as well as a count of how many units are attacking you. Helpful in challenge areas like Night Market or on higher difficulty settings with attribute bars hidden. Silence Indicator: Appears near your reticle when you're silenced and stays on screen until the effect ends. Intended to provide an additional indicator to let you know you're silenced. Works even if you play with the skill bar hidden and combat text off. Plague Indicator: Tints your screen a smoky green while a Plaguebreak plague is on you. If it is removed early and explodes, a chat message reports who removed it, what with, and the explosion damage this client saw. Each Indicator can be turned off in the settings if it's not wanted.

